{'symbol': 'MMC', 'date': '2023-01-04 09:00:00', 'title': 'MARSH MCLENNAN AGENCY ACQUIRES HMS INSURANCE ASSOCIATES', 'text': "WHITE PLAINS, N.Y.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--MARSH MCLENNAN AGENCY (MMA), A SUBSIDIARY OF MARSH, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE ACQUISITION OF HUNT VALLEY, MARYLAND-BASED HMS INSURANCE ASSOCIATES, INC., ONE OF THE NATION'S LARGEST INDEPENDENT AGENCIES. TERMS OF THE ACQUISITION WERE NOT DISCLOSED."}